netshield-dns (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Linux/Debian port of the NetShield DNS Resolver Android app: headless
    UDP+TCP resolver daemon, DoH/DoT/UDP upstreams, hosts-format blocklists,
    custom block/allow/local-record rules, response cache, query log, systemd
    service and the "netshield" admin command.

 -- M. Farhan Hamim <mfhamim95@gmail.com>  @DATE@
